  "body": {
    "focus": "The UX mock and all zoom and pan controls must follow the selected light or dark theme, using the shared theme's colours, and stay readable in both. Zoom and pan must keep working as they do today on every page type, including the docgen fallback page. Pages that are already generated keep their current styling until they are regenerated. The fix must confirm the result by rendering real pages in both themes.",
