        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "UX mock pages now run a theme-only boot script, which they lacked entirely, so their toggle works and they no longer stick on the dark stylesheet. UX card colours use the theme variables, with per-mode status colours checked for 4.5:1 contrast. The companion toolbar uses the themed iv-bar class, and both docgen shells theme svg-pan-zoom's on-diagram controls. Real UX and docgen fallback pages were rendered in both themes through the page's own toggle; screenshots are in docs/standalone/make-ux-mocks-zoom-controls-follow-E20261109f0b3baec/S001/evidence/. The primary Mermaid docgen page could not be captured visually in headless Chrome.",
